stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Normal: Vim mode (the default)

    state "Normal (motions, operators, SPC)" as Normal
    state "Insert (typing)" as Insert
    state "Visual (character, line, block)" as Visual
    state "Command line (:w :q :find :b ...)" as Command
    state "Picker (SPC o, SPC /, SPC B)" as Picker
    state "Text mode (modeless)" as Text
    state "Rendered View (Ctrl+T, --gui)" as RenderedView

    Normal --> Insert: i / a / I / A / o / O
    Insert --> Normal: Esc
    Normal --> Visual: v / V / Ctrl+v
    Visual --> Normal: Esc / y / d / c / > / <
    Normal --> Command: : or Ctrl+;
    Command --> Normal: Enter / Esc
    Normal --> Picker: SPC o / SPC SPC / SPC B
    Picker --> Normal: Enter (open) / Esc
    Normal --> Text: SPC k
    Text --> Normal: Ctrl+Space k
    Normal --> RenderedView: Ctrl+T
    RenderedView --> Normal: Ctrl+T
